kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "package-tui-diff"
purpose: "可复用 Diff 组件（行级与 word-level、可选 side-by-side、CJK 宽度）。"
valid_scope[1]: "packages/xylitol-tui/"
requirements[4]{req_id,title,statement}:
  meta0,"capability-shell","本 capability 由变更 c451-add-package-tui-diff 引入；归档合并后以 delta 增补的 requirements 为准。本壳 MUST 保持非空以满足 BDD 护栏。"
  ptd1,"diff-component-api","xylitol-tui MUST 提供 Diff 组件（及/或 render_diff_lines），接受 display_diff 文本、unified diff 文本或 old/new 行对，输出 Vec of ANSI 行；主题 MUST 经闭包注入；MUST NOT 依赖主 crate xylitol。"
  ptd2,"diff-word-level",当恰好一对相邻删除行与添加行时，Diff MUST 对该对做词级（或字级）对比并用 reverse/word_change 高亮变更片段；多行连续增减 MUST NOT 做词级对比。
  ptd3,"diff-width-cjk","Diff 行宽 MUST 按 visible_width（CJK/emoji）处理；当宽度低于 side-by-side 阈值时 MUST 使用 unified；达到阈值且启用时 MAY 左右对照；MUST NOT 使用 Unicode 表线装饰。"
scenarios[6]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  meta0,"shell-present","","列出 llmanspec/specs/package-tui-diff",spec.toon 存在且 purpose 为中文
  ptd1,"render-line-pair","","DiffInput::LinePair 含一行删除与一行添加","render 输出含着色的 -/+ 行"
  ptd1,"empty-diff","",old 与 new 相同,输出含 (no changes) 或空等价提示
  ptd2,"intra-line-pair","","相邻单行 - 与 + 仅一词不同",变更词带 reverse/word_change
  ptd3,"narrow-unified","","width 小于 side_by_side 阈值且启用 side-by-side 选项",仍渲染 unified 单栏
  ptd3,"cjk-width","",含全角字符的 diff 行,折行/截断按 visible_width 不按字节
